Clinical Course: The sharp incisional pain will steadily diminish day by day. You must use the strong pain relief now to allow your body to move and heal without developing secondary complications like chest infections.

SAFETY-NETTING ADVICE

Seek emergency medical care immediately if the wound suddenly pops open, if thick green or yellow pus leaks out, or if you develop a high fever and chills.

